        1   block-level on error undo, throw.
        2   trigger procedure for delete of ub.xgroupobj.
        3   define buffer buf-GroupObj for xGroupObj.
        4   find first buf-groupobj where buf-groupobj.Parent-GroupObj eq xgroupobj.GroupObj-Code
        5   no-lock no-error.
        6   if avail buf-groupobj
        7   then
        8      return error "У записи есть потомомки. Удаление запрещено."
